<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2014614867/Announcement_header_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear [Name],</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I am happy to share with you that Qantas is continuing to help eligible Qantas Frequent Flyers to maintain their travel benefits. We’ve offered a range of support mechanisms for our members through the pandemic and we are now extending our support even further.<br><br>For Australian and New Zealand based members (whose status is due to expire between now and June 2022) to maintain their Qantas Frequent Flyer status, they just need to book and pay for an eligible flight before their status end date for travel any time before 30 June 2022 and we will extend their status, at its current level, for a further 12 months.<br><br>In addition, we're giving eligible members a head-start at reaching their future status goals by giving them the ability to rollover eligible Status Credits into their next membership year.<br><br>If you, or anyone in your team’s, status is due for review before 30 June 2022, we hope that you’ll be able to take advantage of the status extension and Status Credit rollover by booking an eligible flight.<br><br>For further details, please visit&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status/status-support.html" target="_blank" title="qantas.com/statussupport" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantas.com/statussupport</a>.<br><br>We look forward to welcoming you onboard soon.<br><br>Kind regards,<br><br>[AM name]<br>[AM title]<br><br><em>Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013844708/facebook.jpg" title="Facebook" width="30"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/Qantas" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013844712/twitter.jpg" title="Twitter" width="43"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/qantas/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013844710/instagram.jpg" title="Instagram" width="51"></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/Qantas" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013844713/youtube.jpg" title="Youtube" width="49"></a></font></td><td align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: right; width: 167px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="35" src="https://sslh.teradatadmc.com/qantas-sales/imgproxy/img/2012291297/QF_oneworld_footer_logo-resized.png" title="Qantas" width="167"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="2" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><hr style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 2